rting the research record by ensuring that only valid, rule-compliant transitions are committed to durable history.", "title": "Mechanical Accountability in WAKE Architecture"}], "retrieval_triggers": ["material belief revision or retraction", "new contradiction or counterevidence", "high-consequence decision", "request for justification", "sign that an excerpt may hide a material distinction"]}}, "prev_hash": "b27b6e7313683c12df7330c41e77e92c242212f3b8180efec696bd81050051c9", "hash": "2706e57838dd283bf82aa56efd3601fdffdcbbf2a4b0c9b323800a3b63d41bfd"}, {"seq": 2558, "time": "2026-10-28T19:00:17.235360+00:00", "kind": "observation", "payload": {"actor": "runtime", "content": "{\"base_version\":19,\"inherited_commitments\":[],\"invocation\":\"w-2abf4987295e4dd9\",\"previous_head\":\"364c3797c583f0ba705795488e5a93b899bbab6d62f54d73a1dccef0cb895eeb\",\"process_id\":270,\"scope\":\"Receipt proves state delivery to the provider boundary, not model comprehension.\"}", "id": "r-2abf4987295e4dd9", "source": "runtime:continuity"}, "prev_hash": "364c3797c583f0ba705795488e5a93b899bbab6d62f54d73a1dccef0cb895eeb", "hash": "b27b6e7313683c12df7330c41e77e92c242212f3b8180efec696bd81050051c9"}, {"seq": 2557, "time": "2026-10-28T18:59:36.449533+00:00", "kind": "temporal_observed", "payload": {"cycle_distance": 0, "effective_elapsed_seconds": 611.893734, "effective_scale": 1.0, "effective_seconds_total": 110577.89834, "intervening_events": {"accepted": 0, "attention_assessed": 0, "failed": 0, "observation": 1, "rejected": 0, "research_collected": 0, "squirrel_assessed": 0, "total": 11}, "observed_at": "2026-10-28T18:59:33.441964+00:00", "previous_anchor_time": "2026-10-28T18:49:21.548230+00:00", "regime_id": "reg-df573bb03399f050", "wall_elapsed_seconds": 611.893734}, "prev_hash": "e7c3fbbace120b4060c7f0fbfbbad0b4574d7027d19fa2423fca7be178a7508a", "hash": "364c3797c583f0ba705795488e5a93b899bbab6d62f54d73a1dccef0cb895eeb"}], "related": {}, "next": 12}